  "sentences": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_1",
      "text": "运动对每个人都很重要。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 2560,
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_2",
      "text": "现在很多人的生活很忙，也很累。",
      "startMs": 2560,
      "endMs": 5787,
      "durationMs": 3227,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_3",
      "text": "如果常常运动，身体就会更健康，心情也会更好。",
      "startMs": 5787,
      "endMs": 12080,
      "durationMs": 6293,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_4",
      "text": "运动对身体很好。",
      "startMs": 12080,
      "endMs": 14240,
      "durationMs": 2160,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_5",
      "text": "常常运动的人不容易生病，睡觉也很好。",
      "startMs": 14240,
      "endMs": 19200,
      "durationMs": 4960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_6",
      "text": "医生说，每个星期要运动三次。",
      "startMs": 19200,
      "endMs": 23040,
      "durationMs": 3840,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_7",
      "text": "除了跑步，游泳、打球也很好。",
      "startMs": 23040,
      "endMs": 27600,
      "durationMs": 4560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_8",
      "text": "运动以后，人会觉得舒服。",
      "startMs": 27600,
      "endMs": 30680,
      "durationMs": 3080,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_9",
      "text": "不管多忙，都应该找时间运动。",
      "startMs": 30680,
      "endMs": 34880,
      "durationMs": 4200,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_10",
      "text": "只要常常运动，身体就会很好。",
      "startMs": 34880,
      "endMs": 38640,
      "durationMs": 3760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_11",
      "text": "所以，大家应该找自己喜欢的运动，每天运动三十分钟。",
      "startMs": 38640,
      "endMs": 45600,
      "durationMs": 6960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "sp1_12",
      "text": "时间长了，运动就会变成一种好习惯。",
      "startMs": 45600,
      "endMs": 50000,
      "durationMs": 4400,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_sport_p1_sp1_12.mp3"
    }
